.Dd March 2, 2026
.Dt ELF_IS_LAZY_PARSE_ENABLED 3
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm elf_is_lazy_parse_enabled
.Nd query whether lazy parsing is enabled for an object
.Sh LIBRARY
libelfobj
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.In elfobj.h
.Ft int
.Fn elf_is_lazy_parse_enabled "const elfobj_t *obj"
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Fn elf_is_lazy_parse_enabled
reports whether
.Fa obj
was opened with
.Dv ELFOBJ_OPEN_LAZY_PARSE
semantics.
.Sh RETURN VALUES
Returns non-zero when lazy parsing is enabled, 0 otherwise.
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr elf_open_with_options 3
